namida wa seishun no daiyamondo kimi wo kazaru hikari
Tears are the diamonds of youth, the lights decorating you

00:21:16.817 --> 00:21:18.527
All right!

00:21:18.527 --> 00:21:22.573
We'll win Love Live, no matter what!

00:21:22.573 --> 00:21:23.740
Yeah!

00:21:28.203 --> 00:21:29.663
Sheesh.

00:21:31.164 --> 00:21:33.250
They're all out of order.

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:34.793
I wanted to read the rest...

00:21:35.335 --> 00:21:38.630
I'm amazed she can be the
student council president like this.

00:21:39.298 --> 00:21:40.173
There.

00:21:41.842 --> 00:21:43.510
Oh, come on!

00:21:46.013 --> 00:21:49.016
I can't believe it. She's even got
documents all over the place.

00:21:50.058 --> 00:21:52.394
